MIT License. See LICENSE.

Fork point: upstream commit 87c717c (2026-09-13). Commits after it through 35c744c
(chip map, config-table fix, wiring, snake) are Jason McPheron's own picowallet work,
made before the project was renamed.

Reused from picowallet, largely unchanged:
  firmware/atecc.py     ATECC608 driver (I2C, wake/retry, provisioning)
  firmware/keccak.py    pure-Python keccak256, used by firmware/safe_tx.py
  firmware/eip712.py    the pattern firmware/safe_tx.py follows
  emu/                  the MicroPython emulator and tools/emu
  and everything else in firmware/, app/, case/, reference/ and buildlog/

Third-party material inherited from picowallet keeps its own license:
  case/waveshare-13-pico-lcd-case-tomas-plass.stl   Tomas Plass, CC BY-NC 4.0
  reference/seedsigner/                              SeedSigner, MIT
  app/                                               Scaffold-ETH 2, MIT

New in PicoQuorum: firmware/safe_tx.py, test-vectors/, tools/vectors/, docs/,
hardware/, cad/, contracts/.
